or TSV files as in \code{\link[=bohr_cis]{bohr_cis()}}. \code{traits} and \code{covariates} are data frames
(or matrices, or TSV files whose first column holds the IDs) with one row
per sample or per individual: rows are matched by sample ID, else by
individual ID (see \code{individual}). Covariates can also be given per tissue
(a list named by tissue or a folder of \verb{<tissue>.tsv} files).
